UID:ida-2027-deadline-abstract@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART:20261129T105959Z
DTEND:20261129T115959Z
SUMMARY:IDA 2027 · Abstract submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:International Symposium on Intelligent Data Analysis\nMeeting: 
 2027-04-21 to 2027-04-23\, Pisa\, Italy\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026
 -10-29\nCutoff note: CFP lists dates as AOE but says 'All deadlines are 2
 3:59:59 SST (Anywhere on Earth)'\; SST (Samoa\, UTC-11) is 1 h before AoE
 . Earliest instant stored.\nFormat: Paper-based / interdisciplinary\nOffi
 cial source: https://ida2027.eu/regular-paper-track/\nVenue Radar: https:
 //gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ida-2027\nNotes: Official IDA 2027 site 
 confirms the 25th symposium in Pisa\, Apr 21-23\, 2027 (venue TBA). Deadl
 ines are labelled AoE\, but the regular-track CFP also says 'All deadline
 s are 23:59:59 SST'\, read as Samoa time (UTC-11)\, so its rows store tha
 t earlier -11:00 instant per their cutoff notes\; the PhD Forum page stat
 es only AOE (-12:00). The abstract gate follows the abstract-then-paper C
 MT schedule\, as in 2026\; the page does not explicitly call it mandatory
 .
CATEGORIES:Data Mining & Data Science,Machine Learning,Probabilistic\, Caus
 al & Uncertainty ML,Time Series & Sequential Data
URL:https://ida2027.eu/regular-paper-track/
END:VEVENT
